window.products.push({"id":431249,"name":"Replacement Tumbler Lids, 30Oz Spill Proof and Splash Resistant Lid For YETI Rambler Tumbler, SOEOR Tumbler, Ozark Trail cup and other brands Vacuum i","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":6.89,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/718xrqMosFL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Dear friends, have you ever bought a nice tumbler but no lid or with the leakage lid? Have you often worried about spilling contents, especially when carrying a hot beverage tumbler?All these problems can be solved perfectly by our spill proof lid.This tumbler lid are designed for Yeti Rambler, RTIC, Ozark Trail, Old Style Rtic, Tervis and most other 30 oz cups. Prevent beverages from spilling. With this lid, you have not worry about leaking, It will be very convenient when you use for driving, hiking, cycling, camping. Why choose our 30 oz tumbler lids? 1.Featuring a new locking mechanism, the clasp is locking tight, liquid will not leak from the hole.2.It's especially helpful when having hot drink in the mug or tumbler, No more worry about scald.3.Have one of lids in your cup in car, avoid any damage to the seat accidently. Prevent any beverages from spilling.4.Straw friendly, This yeti tumbler lid has a central straw hole, Your straw won't get tangled up with the latch with this yeti cup lid. Spec. Model:30 oz Tumbler Lids Fits for: YETI 30oz rambler tumbler, Ozark Trail 30oz Tumbler, RTIC 30 oz Tumbler, SIC Cup,GUS 30 oz, MalloMe 30 oz, BonBon 30 oz, Magnum STEEL 30 oz, BEAST 30oz, X-Chef 30 oz, Aoocan 30 oz, Utopia 30 oz tumblers. Not fit for:New style rtci 30oz tumbler, Simple Modern Tumblers, Takeya Thermo Tumbler, RTIC Tumblers with Polar Bear logo. polar camel cup. Mossy Oak cup etc. Material: AS Color: BlackPackage:1* 30oz Tumbler Lids(excluding cup). Note *Keep the flip-up piece open before you install the lid on you tumbler and avoid using in microwave.*If your tumbler is RTIC, please pay attention that the 30 Oz lids only suitable for the RTIC old style tumbler with the diameter of 3.5 inch. DO NOT FIT FOR THE NEW RTIC WITH POLAR BEAR LOGO.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/718xrqMosFL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"GWY","source_asin":"B0927P9FC5","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-431249","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0927P9FC5","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0927P9FC5","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
