window.products.push({"id":431325,"name":"Bathroom Rug Non Slip Bath Mat for Bathroom Water Absorbent Soft Microfiber Shaggy Bathroom Mat Machine Washable Bath Rug for Bathroom Thick Plush Rug","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":22.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81ZbAeCPPOL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"❤【INCREDIBLY SOFT】- Premium bath mat features a luxurious, fluffy and soft pile that soothes tired feet and shields toes from the cold floor. The density and plushness of our pile surpasses that of most other brands. Our non slip microfiber bath mats were stitched with reinforced seams for added strength.The upgraded microfiber surface ensures exceptional ventilation, softness and comfort with soft bristles that do not wear off easily. ❤【ULTRA ABSORBENT】- High-pile, constructed out of premium thick microfiber fabric.The microfiber bath rug is much more absorbent than cotton bath rugs.Our bath rug is extra absorbent,the top layer of this rug quickly and efficiently traps and absorbs excess water and moisture from the bath, shower and sink, so you can worry less about wet floors. ❤【EASY TO CLEAN】- The microfiber strands dry five times faster than ordinary non-slip bath mat.Refetone bath rugs have been tested and can be machine washed and machine dried time and time again. The upgrading technology adopted makes the polyester fiber solid and practical, not easy to fall off.Our durable bath rug is designed to last wash after wash, and won’t come apart like many of the cheaper rugs out there. ❤【ANTI-SLIP & STRONG BACKING】- We researched to find the backing with the strongest hold and found it! The Refetone Premium Bath Rug includes the most durable backing that helps it stay put on your bathroom floors. We’ve truly taken the backing of this bath rug to a whole new level! WARNING: Place rug on DRY SMOOTH FLOOR only. Water under rug can cause it to slip. Keep bottom of rug dry. ❤【Customer Care】 - You can have peace of mind - Refetone earned customer's spurs and have been a trusted brand for unsurpassed quality and style. If you are at all unsatisfied with your product, please contact us (through Amazon if past the standard return window) and we will be happy to provide you with your choice of a replacement or refund. We stand by our products 100% and want our customers to love them as much as we do!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81ZbAeCPPOL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"REFETONE","source_asin":"B07Y4PTMMY","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-431325","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07Y4PTMMY","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07Y4PTMMY","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
