window.products.push({"id":431415,"name":"Celeste 60 Piece Flatware Set by Villeroy & Boch - Service for 12","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":208.53,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61rpdFmukGL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"PREMIUM CRAFTSMANSHIP. Villeroy & Boch is an innovative company with outstanding design expertise and a long history dating back over 270 years. From the tiles on board the Titanic and in the Holland Tunnel in New York to tableware series produced specially for the Vatican and royal families ? during this period, the brand Villeroy & Boch has left lasting impressions all over the world. PASTORAL THEME. The Audun range features four stylish designs with intricate landscapes portrayed in a copperplate style and graceful, floral patterns in an elegant yellow and grey. The 4 ranges are Femme, Promenade, Fleur and Chase. These 4 patterns together yield a strong fashion statement to dress up your table or hang decorative plates on the wall. RUSTIC FLAIR. Audun is a small village in what is now the Lorraine Provence of France and was the first pottery set up by the Boch members of the family. Villeroy & Boch exquisitely bridges past, present, and future inspired by designs from the turn of the last century. This coffee pot forms part of Villeroy & Boch's country-style pattern Audun Ferme. Holds approximately 43.75oz. Made of premium porcelain, it is dishwasher and microwave safe. TIMELESS GIFT. The variety and design of the products include everything consumers need to make their homes more beautiful: from high-quality home accessories to crockery, cutlery, and glasses. Anyone looking for inspiring gifts is sure to find the perfect items at Villeroy & Boch. SPECIAL MOMENTS IN LIFE. Reflecting this philosophy, Villeroy & Boch adds a decorative touch to its customers? living environments, combining passion with design expertise and innovative strength. Since its foundation in 1748, the company has developed to become one of the world's leading lifestyle brands and creates feel-good moments and living spaces with the best ceramics from its Bathroom & Wellness and Dining & Lifestyle Divisions.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61rpdFmukGL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Villeroy & Boch","source_asin":"B076MYC3TL","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-431415","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B076MYC3TL","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B076MYC3TL","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
