window.products.push({"id":431446,"name":"Details and Traditions Frosted Olive 3-Item SET 622S - Wedding Lazo Rosary Arras Silver - Swarovski Crystal Wedding Lasso","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":119.98,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81Za++8vFmL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"This frosted Olive Shaped Wedding Lazo - L azo de Bodas has frosted and clear rhinestones giving it an elegant look. The silver plated crucifix features a detailed wood grain on the cross. Ultimately giving a traditional touch on your wedding day. Matching Rosary and Arras combo set. What is a Wedding LAZO or Lazo de boda? The lazo symbolizes lifetime unity or the everlasting union of the bride and groom after officially becoming husband and wife. It is an item with two loops Rosary that are joined at the center with a cross. During the wedding lazo Lazo de Bodas , made of two rosaries joined together is placed around the bride and groom as a symbol of unity. Each loop is draped over the bride's and groom's shoulders as they kneel at the altar. Wedding Lazo / Lazo de Bodas Our wedding lazo / lazo de bodas is handmade with detail and keeping the traditional wedding ceremony values in mind that can be passed on for generations to come or in some cases the bride and groom my choose to display their Wedding Lazo - Lazo be body while others prefer to keep it stored away for their future loved one to use it on their special day.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81Za++8vFmL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Details and Traditions","source_asin":"B0116VO5N4","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-431446","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0116VO5N4","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0116VO5N4","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
