window.products.push({"id":431572,"name":"Ice Cube Tray with Lid - 2 Pack Silicone Ice Cube Trays for Freezer , Reusable Flexible Ice Molds , Easy-release, Bpa Free，for Cocktail, Whiskey, Baby","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":9.96,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/718ToGnreZL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"These ice trays for freezer have many uses. Ice trays can be used to make ice cubes for beverages, coffee and wine. It can also be used to make chocolate and homemade butter candies to experience the fun of DIY food.   How to use: 1. Before using for the first time, please wash with hot water to remove odor.  2. Fill the ice tray with about 80% water, and then close the lid.  3. Leave it for 3 minutes or sprinkle some water to melt the ice a little.  4. Push into the bottom of the tray to remove the ice cubes.  5. After using, rinse the ice tray and air dry.   Name: Silicone ice tray mold Material: Silicone Mold size: 8.0*4.0*1.3 inches  Ice cube size: 1.06*0.60*0.60 inches  Shape: Honeycomb shape Temperature resistance: -40°~230°  Capacity: 20ml Weight: 116g (weighing with lid) Packing list: 2×ice tray mould  Note: 1. Clean with mild cleaning and hot water before using for the first time.  2. Do not fill up with water to avoid ice cubes sticking to the lid.  3. Do not use strong cleaning, metal brushes to clean ice molds.  4. After cleaning, put it in a dry place to avoid sun exposure.  5. After taking it out of the refrigerator for a while. The ice cubes can be released easily with just a slight rotation.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/718ToGnreZL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"N\\\\A","source_asin":"B08YK7K1V4","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-431572","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08YK7K1V4","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08YK7K1V4","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
