window.products.push({"id":431753,"name":"Crystal Allies Materials: 1/2lb Bulk Rough Septarian Stones from Madagascar - Large 1\"+","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51SKwLP+42L._AC_.jpg","description":"Septarian is known as a concentration stone that provides grounding and shielding protection of one's physical, mental, and emotional body. For individuals who feel unsure of a certain direction in which to channel their energy, Septarian is an ideal stone to help aid in determining which direction one should choose to progress. By providing support in the betterment of one's mental capacity, Septarian is known to help with communication and speech. It provides its wearer with the ability to speak freely and communicate on a level in which they are able to express their emotions fully. It is also helpful that Septarian omits a sincere and loving energy pattern, providing truth and emotional grounding in a person's words. Not surprisingly, this stone loves to be held. When held, overtime, it is said to omit a kind and loving energy pattern. This also helps in the regulation of ones spiritual and mental self. Septarian comes from the Latin word \"Septem\". Known for being a great stone for communication, Septarian has been used during public speaking, as it is said to enhance a person's ability to communicate effectively amoungst a group. The stone is also used by healers to diagnois specific diseases and give insight into its causes. These stones were first discovered in the Gulf of Mexico, and have reached inland to Southern Utah. They are also found in Madagascar where there are similar sea levels.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51SKwLP+42L._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Crystal Allies","source_asin":"B009JJQGQ0","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-431753","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B009JJQGQ0","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B009JJQGQ0","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":431754,"name":"Sagaform Double Wall Porcelain Take Away Mug with Drip Proof Silicone Lid, White, 12-Ounce","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":12.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71DkKVcdTfL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"For over 20 years Sagaform has created warm and loving relationships. They do this by offering value priced and well-designed products in beautiful gift boxes. They strive to choose products that are as fun to give as they are to receive. Through cooperation with well-known designers Sagaform offers gifts with that little extra, and something that fits in everyone's home. Designs are functional and bring joy. Sagaform knows how important it is to have the right gift, no matter the occasion or price. Sagaform works hard every day to give you gift solutions for you and your friends. Eating together is, as is giving gifts, a way to build strong relationships. Sagaform has always combined gift giving and dining to offer products for the kitchen and the fine table. Finding the perfect hostess gift is easy with Sagaform. A travel mug should do two things; keep your coffee/tea hot longer and have a lid that does not drip .. this great travel mug does both. Created in twin-walled porcelain, your beverage will stay warm longer while still being comfortable to hold. The high quality silicone lid is virtually drip proof. Holds 12 oz. and measures 7\" x 3 1/2\" - (Giftbox)","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71DkKVcdTfL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Sagaform","source_asin":"B004ZTDADG","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-431754","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B004ZTDADG","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B004ZTDADG","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
