window.products.push({"id":431837,"name":"Glow In The Dark Star Blankets for Adults Couch Blanket Plush Fleece Blankets with Stars For Bedroom Living Room Luminous Glow Blanket For Kids With S","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":18.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91GOHQbDbUL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"The fascination of gazing at the moon and stars is something that everyone has experienced or wants to experience once in their life, but what if you can bring that essence to the comfort of your own home. If this is what exactly you have been dreaming and searching for then Congratulations you have reached your destination, as GramVine presents Glow in Dark Moon and Stars Blanket for Kids . This Fluffy Glow in Dark Blanket will keep your kids warm in the cool nights, would let them gaze at the stars in the comfort of their beds and you could see a big smile on their face. These Lightweight Moon and Star Blanket proliferate light in such a way that it's mysterious yet intriguing and awakens the quest for knowledge in the minds of the kids. This Gl in Dark Throw Blankets are cozy enough and are not confined to be used in your bedroom, you can use them while watching movies on the couch or you can carry them while you're traveling with your loved ones and family to gaze at real stars and moon in the sky. this Gl in Dark Fleece Blankets won't affect the sleep and health of your children, you just need to keep these blankets under direct sunlight or under normal light for nearly 30 minutes and after that, you're all set to use these Cozy and Warm Blanket. You can carry these Fleece Glow In Dark Blanket with you on your camping, traveling, hiking as they are lightweight and easy to maintain all you need to keep in mind is that the water temperature should be under 80 F in either way to keep the glowing effect. Gift these Glow In Dark Moon and Star Blanket to your kids and loved ones on Christmas, New Year, Thanksgiving, Birthdays, Anniversaries, or on any special occasion. Just but this GramVine Glow In Dark Moon and Star Blanket and bring smiles on","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91GOHQbDbUL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"GramVine","source_asin":"B08NQ2YN1L","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-431837","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08NQ2YN1L","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08NQ2YN1L","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
