window.products.push({"id":431927,"name":"Studio Oh! Travel Tin Hand-Poured Scented Candle Available in 9 Fragrances, Prosecco and Vanilla","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61y4GVKLLZL._AC_SL1333_.jpg","description":"The simple pleasures of fragrance can conjure up memories, transport you to exotic places or simply add a little ambiance while reading, cooking or entertaining. And, thanks to studio Oh, the pleasures of fragrance can travel with you in a beautifully designed tin that fits easily into a purse, tote, backpack or carryon bag. Inside the tin is a 6.5 oz. Scented soy and wax blend candle with up to 50 hours of burn time. The candle is hand-poured in the USA; the decorative travel tin can be reused as a trinket dish or as a small container for homemade lotions and lip balms. There are six delicious scents from which to choose; how nice to have fragrance wherever life's adventures may lead! the passionate and creative designers at studio Oh believe that products should not only be relevant to the needs of today's consumers but also should be environmentally responsible, infused with energy, elevated design, richly-saturated colors and fine craftsmanship. From notecards, stationery and journals that move and inspire to candles, decorative accessories and stainless steel water bottles with plain-old-amazing designs, studio Oh invites you to explore their extraordinary products available on Amazon.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61y4GVKLLZL._AC_SL1333_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Studio Oh!","source_asin":"B0797G77JB","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-431927","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0797G77JB","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0797G77JB","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
